The development priority is fixed as:

P0  Baseline / instrumentation
 ↓
P1  Crosshair
 ↓
P2  Data loading
 ↓
P3  Timeframe processing
 ↓
P4  Python ↔ JavaScript transfer
 ↓
P5  Chart rendering
 ↓
P6  RAM
 ↓
P7  Drawing
 ↓
